  "description": "A lightweight, high-performance mediator library for .NET that implements the mediator pattern with support for command dispatching, middleware pipelines, pre/post processors, and comprehensive exception handling. Features include priority-based execution ordering, both AOT-compatible generic dispatch and runtime polymorphic dispatch, and seamless integration with Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.",
